# Cloudflare Pages response headers.
#
# COOP + COEP together make the page cross-origin isolated, which is what
# unlocks the multithreaded AVIF encoder later. Without them the app still
# works, it just encodes AVIF on one thread.
#
# Consequence to remember: under require-corp, any cross-origin subresource
# needs a CORP header or it is blocked. This app loads nothing external by
# design, so Rocket Loader and Email Obfuscation must stay OFF at the zone
# level. Rocket Loader injects a script from ajax.cloudflare.com, which would
# be blocked here and would also break the "no network requests" promise.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp

# Vite fingerprints everything under /assets, so it is safe to cache forever.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
